  translation {
    text: "Affected stops:\r\nCherryvale Rd & Baseline Rd (#22863) (eastbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Platt Middle School (#22859) (eastbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Stearns Ave (#22817) (eastbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Lakeview Dr (#22819) (eastbound)\r\n6800 Block Baseline Rd (#22821) (eastbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Mallard Pond Dr (#22823) (eastbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & 75th St (#22825) (eastbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & 75th St (#22826) (westbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Mallard Pond Dr (#22824) (westbound)\r\n6800 Block Baseline Rd (#22822) (westbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Lakeview Dr (#22820) (westbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Stearns Ave (#22818) (westbound)\r\nBaseline Rd & Platt Middle School (#22860) (westbound)\r\nCherryvale Rd & Dimmit Dr (#22814) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 225 get on/off buses at:\r\nBaseline Rd & Cherryvale Rd (#22812)\r\nBaseline Rd & Wewoka Dr (#22827)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 225 get on/off buses at:\r\nBaseline Rd & Wewoka Dr (#22828)\r\nBaseline Rd & Cherryvale Rd (#22813)"
